00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:25.340
Toby's line crosses the main road behind the station and for a short way follows a farm lane.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.950
Frosty weather makes the muddy lane rock hard and very slippery.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.940
