00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:51.410
Certainly, replied Sir Topham Hatt, if your manager agrees.

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.040
And so it was arranged.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.840
Now Mavis is as happy as can be,

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.980
and Sir Topham Hatt thinks she's really useful in...

