00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.560
Sometimes a little time is all we need

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.240
to understand what we need to know.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:25.630
Hey, follow me, and welcome to Schemer's House of Deals!

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:27.190
