Schemer took all my furniture

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.480
and boarded up my signal house.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.300
So I'm having to rough it out here.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.020
Believe me, it's rough.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.650
This is terrible.

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:44.090
We didn't mean this to happen.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.050
